"Defines the default font size for all text in the report including the "
"Report Title."
msgstr ""
"Anger förvald teckenstorlek för all text i rapporten, inklusive "
"rapporttiteln."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Default Object Alignment"
msgstr "Förvald objektjustering"

#: lib/html_reports.php
