msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Grafträd"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Graph Tree Branch"
msgstr "Gren i grafträd"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid ""
"Select a Tree Branch to use for Graphs and Devices.  Devices will be "
"considered as Branches."
msgstr ""
"Välj en trädgren för grafer och enheter. Enheter behandlas som grenar."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Cascade to Branches"
msgstr "Inkludera undergrenar"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Should all Branch Graphs be rendered?"
msgstr "Ska alla grenars grafer visas?"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Select a Site to filter for Devices and Graphs."
msgstr "Välj en plats för att filtrera enheter och grafer."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Select a Device Template to use to filter for Devices or Graphs."
msgstr "Välj en enhetsmall för att filtrera enheter eller grafer."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Graph Name Regular Expression"
msgstr "Reguljärt uttryck för grafnamn"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid ""
"A Perl compatible regular expression (REGEXP) used to select Graphs to "
"include from the Tree or Device."
msgstr ""
"Ett Perl-kompatibelt reguljärt uttryck (REGEXP) för att välja grafer från "
"trädet eller enheten."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid ""
"The Graph End time will be set to the scheduled report send time.  So, if "
"you wish the end time on the various Graphs to be midnight, ensure you send "
"the report at midnight.  The Graph Start time will be the End Time minus the"
" Graph Timespan."
msgstr ""
"Grafens sluttid sätts till den schemalagda tiden för rapportutskick. Skicka "
"därför rapporten vid midnatt om grafernas sluttid ska vara midnatt. Grafens "
"starttid är sluttiden minus grafens tidsintervall."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Alignment of the Item"
msgstr "Objektets justering"

